    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d500">

                <pb facs="0864" n="850" xml:id="pg850"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Messrs. Parson &amp;
                            French, attorneys for United States, to Mr. Hoar, Attorney-General.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <dateline><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilmington, N. C.</hi></placeName>,
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1869-10-12"><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >October</hi> 12, 1869</date>.</dateline>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">E. R. Hoar</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Attorney-General:</hi></p>
                <p>Have not libelled the Hornet, but are holding her officers under warrant. Shall
                    we file libel?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><seg type="margin">[180]</seg> *PARSON &amp; PRENCH,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Attorneys for United States.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
